   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Perfective future",
     "texto": [
      "The future of a perfective verb is formed by conjugating it with the personal endings of the non-past. Although the form looks like the present, it expresses the future: **сделаю** («I will do»), **куплю** («I will buy»), **прочитаю** («I will read and finish»). It presents the future action as a whole with an end point.",
      "The forms keep the personal endings: **сделаю** (I), **сделаешь** (you)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Imperfective future",
     "texto": [
      "To talk about a future activity without focusing on it as a completed action, the conjugated **буду** + infinitive is used: **Я буду читать** («I will be reading»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
